Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Diwali was two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So why the diyas again tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.03,0:00:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because tonight is Dev Diwali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dev Diwali falls on Kartik Purnima,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:13.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first full moon after Diwali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This year, that's today: Tuesday, 24 November.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:19.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the old story goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tripurasura had three flying cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:24.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,They could fall only when all three lined up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:26.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,and were struck by a single arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,On Kartik Purnima the three cities lined up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:34.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Lord Shiva destroyed Tripura with one arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:37.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why Shiva is called Tripurari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is believed the gods came to Kashi to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,bathed in the Ganga and lit diyas on the ghats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:48.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is the Diwali of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even today, Varanasi's ghats glow with diyas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.87,0:00:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and many people float lamps on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:58.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lighting a diya this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:00:59.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Comment: diyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
